    <briefdescription>
<para>Analytic engine for American Margrabe option. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements formulae from &quot;The Value of an American Option to Exchange One Asset for Another&quot;, W. Margrabe, Journal of Finance, 33, 177-86.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000006"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
